flowchart LR
    U[Judge / Operator] --> UI[VisionGuard Web UI / FastAPI]
    UI --> AG[Agent Orchestrator]
    AG --> CV[OpenCV 5 / COOL on AWS Graviton4]
    CV --> EV[Visual Evidence]
    EV --> V[VCTS Trust Engine]
    V --> AG
    AG -->|ACT| A[Alert / Action]
    AG -->|VERIFY / RE-OBSERVE| TOOL[Agent-selected OpenCV tool]
    TOOL --> CV
    AG -->|low trust| H[Human Approval]
    UI --> S3[(Amazon S3 Evidence)]
    AG --> DDB[(DynamoDB Trace)]
    AG --> CW[CloudWatch Metrics]
    EC2[EC2 Graviton4 + COOL AMI] --- UI
    IAM[IAM Instance Role] --- EC2
